49}&amp;=\\frac{(\\term{count}{n}-1)\\term{centered}{c_i}\\term{spatialLag}{\\left(20.3142\\right)}}{\\term{sumOfSquares}{M_2}},\n&amp;\\term{spatialLag}{\\left(20.3142\\right)}&amp;=\\sum_j\\term{weight}{w_{ij}}\\term{neighborCentered}{c_j}\\\\\n\\term{zScores}{-3.95958}&amp;=\\frac{\\operatorname{sign}(\\term{centered}{c_i})(\\term{spatialLag}{\\left(20.3142\\right)}-\\term{weightSum}{W_i}\\term{otherMean}{\\mu})}{\\sqrt{\\term{lagVariance}{V_i}}},\n&amp;\\term{lagVariance}{V_i}&amp;=\\term{otherVariance}{\\sigma^2}\\frac{\\term{others}{N}\\term{squareSum}{S_{1i}}-\\term{weightSum}{W_i}^2}{\\term{others}{N}-1}\\\\\n\\term{others}{N}&amp;=\\term{count}{n}-1,\n&amp;\\term{otherMean}{\\mu}&amp;=-\\frac{\\term{centered}{c_i}}{\\term{others}{N}},\n&amp;\\term{otherVariance}{\\sigma^2}&amp;=\\frac{\\term{sumOfSquares}{M_2}-\\term{centered}{c_i}^2}{\\term{others}{N}}-\\term{otherMean}{\\mu}^2\\\\\n\\term{weightSum}{W_i}&amp;=\\sum_j\\term{weight}{w_{ij}},\n&amp;\\term{squareSum}{S_{1i}}&amp;=\\sum_j\\term{weight}{w_{ij}}^2\n\\end{aligned}</pre><p class=\"lens-ascii\">I_i = (n-1) c_i L_i / M2; L_i = sum_j w_ij c_j; z_i = sign(c_i) (L_i - W_i mu) / sqrt(V_i); V_i = sigma^2 (N S1_i - W_i^2)/(N-1); N = n-1; mu = -c_i/N; sigma^2 = (M2-c_i^2)/N-mu^2; W_i = sum_j w_ij; S1_i = sum_j w_ij^2. c = x - mean; M2 = sum c^2 over analysis rows. Positive weights to other analysis rows only; row weights are re-standardized over unmasked neighbors. Undefined z when n &lt; 3, c_i = 0, too few neighbors, or nonpositive variance.</p></div></div><p>no neighbourhood declared by the domain pack</p><p>apple</p></section>",
